  "description": {
   "en": "The protagonist, Asahi, returns to her hometown after seven years. On her first day at the new school, Asahi is happy to be reunited with her beloved childhood friend, Haruhiko, but she soon sees something terrifying outside the window. At that moment, the classroom is enveloped in a strange atmosphere...",
   "ja": "この町の人々は【何か】を隠しているー… ７年ぶり生まれた故郷に帰ってきた主人公・朝陽。 大好きな幼馴染・晴彦に久々に再会し心踊らせていた。 緊張しながらも転校初日が過ごせそうと思った矢先、 朝陽は窓の外に＜恐ろしいもの＞を見てしまうー…。"
  },
